      "content": "it’s just that the \"resting\" doesn't really help. i wake up and it’s still the same. i feel like a chapter in a book that ended a long time ago, but for some reason, the book is still being forced to stay open. it feels wrong, like i'm overstaying my welcome in a world that has already moved on to something better. does that even make sense?",
